# Glottical live meeting ops

When debugging live meetings, classroom join, LiveKit audio, or deploy:

1. Read credentials from `.env.ops.local` (gitignored). Do not ask the user for VPS password if already set there.
2. LiveKit VPS: `LIVEKIT_VPS_HOST` / user/password — config at `/opt/livekit/livekit.yaml`, container `mx-livekit`.
3. Hostinger app: SSH port `65002`, path `HOSTINGER_APP_PATH`. If `HOSTINGER_SSH_PASSWORD` empty, ask once and save into `.env.ops.local`.
4. After code fixes: push to GitHub; deploy Hostinger with `git pull && php artisan view:clear`.
5. Teacher/student must share the same LiveKit `room` claim (`ClassroomMeeting::liveRoomName()` or `LiveSession.room_name`). UI must show participant presence even without camera.
